</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="cf-container">
  <div class="cf-header">
    <div class="cf-error-code">Error 403 <span class="cf-badge-forbidden">Forbidden</span></div>
    <h1 class="cf-error-title">Access denied</h1>
    <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-top: 4px;">
      This website is utilizing security services to protect against unauthorized access.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cf-columns">
    <div class="cf-column">
      <h2>What happened?</h2>
      <p>
        The security engine has blocked this request. The action you performed triggered strict security policies or your IP address is not permitted to access this resource.
      </p>
      <p>
        Common triggers include requesting administrative endpoints from untrusted networks, triggering automated rate limits, or failing security verification.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-column">
      <h2>What can I do?</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>If you are a visitor:</strong><br>
        Please try again later or contact the website administrator to request access. Be sure to provide the Ray ID and details shown at the bottom of this page.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>If you are the website owner:</strong><br>
        Review your Firewall & Access Control Rules to confirm whether this request matches an active block filter.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <button class="cf-btn" onclick="location.reload()">Reload Page</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cf-highlight-box">
    <p>
      <strong>Security Notice:</strong> All activities are logged and monitored for unauthorized access attempts. Continued violations may result in a permanent IP block.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cf-footer">
    <div class="cf-footer-item">
      Cloud Performance &amp; Security Layer &bull; Incident ID: <span class="cf-ray-id" id="ray-id">8f219c4b78a10e42</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cf-footer-item">
      Timestamp: <span id="cf-time">2026-09-27 09:57:00 UTC</span> &bull; Your IP: <em>Restricted / Hidden</em>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  try {
    var now = new Date();
    document.getElementById('cf-time').textContent = now.toISOString().replace('T', ' ').substr(0, 19) + ' UTC';
    var hash = Array.prototype.map.call(new Uint8Array(8), function(x){return ('00'+((Math.random()*256)|0).toString(16)).slice(-2)}).join('');
    document.getElementById('ray-id').textContent = '8f' + hash;
  } catch(e){}
</script>

</body>
</html>
